---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<meta name='robots' content='noindex, nofollow' />
<BaseLayout title='Privacy Policy' description='Privacy Policy for thomid.me'>
	<div class='container'>
		<main class='prose dark:prose-invert'>
			<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class='text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400'>Last updated: 27 April 2026</p>

			<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
			<p>
				This Privacy Policy describes how thomid.me ("we", "us", or "this site") as well as thicket.au handles information when you visit
				this website. We are committed to protecting your privacy.
			</p>

			<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
			<p>This site does not require account registration or the submission of personal information to access its content.</p>
			<p>
				We use <a href='https://umami.is' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>Umami Analytics</a> to collect basic, non-personal information
				about visits to this site, including pages viewed and general geographic location. This data is used solely to understand site usage and
				is not used to identify individual users.
			</p>

			<h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>
			<p>Any analytics data collected is used exclusively to:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Understand how visitors use this site</li>
				<li>Improve the user experience</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>4. Cookies</h2>
			<p>
				This site may use essential cookies for site functionality and analytics cookies (via Umami) to understand visitor behaviour. You
				may disable cookies in your browser if you prefer not to have this data collected.
			</p>

			<h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
			<p>
				This site may include links to or embeds from third-party services (e.g., social media platforms). These services may have their own
				privacy policies.
			</p>

			<h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
			<p>Analytics data collected by Umami is retained for a period of 12 months before being automatically deleted.</p>

			<h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
			<p>
				You have the right to opt out of analytics tracking by disabling cookies in your browser. You may also contact us to request access
				to, correction of, or deletion of any personal data we may hold.
			</p>

			<h2>8. Data Security</h2>
			<p>
				We take reasonable steps to protect any information collected on this site. However, no method of transmission over the internet is
				completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
			</p>

			<h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
			<p>
				This site is not intended for children under 13 years of age, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
			</p>

			<h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
			<p>
				We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.
			</p>

			<h2>11. Contact</h2>
			<p>
				If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact:<br />
				<a href='mailto:thomas@thomid.me'>thomas@thomid.me</a>
			</p>
		</main>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
